1
00:00:47,100 --> 00:00:48,360
I really didn't expect

2
00:00:48,580 --> 00:00:50,240
his methods to be so ruthless.

3
00:00:50,880 --> 00:00:54,480
No wonder Young Master Long hurried away with his men last night.

4
00:00:54,580 --> 00:00:55,840
If I had followed them,

5
00:00:55,980 --> 00:00:57,640
this wouldn't have happened.

6
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:05,540
How about we try again?

7
00:01:05,980 --> 00:01:08,640
Actually, there is still a turning point.

8
00:01:10,580 --> 00:01:11,710
What turning point?

9
00:01:13,180 --> 00:01:15,039
My father has a notebook

10
00:01:15,600 --> 00:01:16,680
that records

11
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:19,000
the secrets of those in power

12
00:01:19,780 --> 00:01:20,840
to control them.

13
00:01:21,840 --> 00:01:24,440
As long as we can get our hands on that notebook,

14
00:01:25,740 --> 00:01:28,070
no one will be able to protect him anymore.

15
00:01:28,180 --> 00:01:28,660
Indeed.

16
00:01:29,940 --> 00:01:31,600
If we don't get that notebook,

17
00:01:32,200 --> 00:01:35,460
we won't be able to catch him no matter how many times we try.

18
00:01:39,180 --> 00:01:40,380
Where is the notebook?

19
00:01:40,380 --> 00:01:41,180
At home.

20
00:01:41,680 --> 00:01:42,800
We need to split up.

21
00:01:46,800 --> 00:01:49,460
Lawyer Gu and I will find a way to stall the others

22
00:01:50,180 --> 00:01:52,580
and make sure no one is at my father's house.

23
00:02:01,160 --> 00:02:02,040
When the time comes,

24
00:02:02,040 --> 00:02:04,370
you sneak into the house and get the notes.

25
00:02:06,680 --> 00:02:07,940
We have limited time.

26
00:02:08,880 --> 00:02:11,980
I'll leave everything to you.

27
00:02:23,079 --> 00:02:23,880
Sir.

28
00:02:24,440 --> 00:02:26,020
Are you the one who needs a lock opened?

29
00:02:26,020 --> 00:02:26,880
Please come in.

30
00:02:38,400 --> 00:02:39,600
You want to open this lock?

31
00:02:39,600 --> 00:02:40,460
Can you open it?

32
00:02:41,600 --> 00:02:43,000
I can open it,

33
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:44,480
but it will take some time.

34
00:02:44,480 --> 00:02:45,340
I'll pay extra.

35
00:02:45,340 --> 00:02:46,740
I'll open it right away.

36
00:03:03,520 --> 00:03:04,520
Look at Yangyang.

37
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:06,060
Once he's on stage,

38
00:03:06,200 --> 00:03:07,880
his charisma really shows.

39
00:03:08,580 --> 00:03:10,240
Yes, it's really different.

40
00:03:11,580 --> 00:03:13,140
I had the company's operations department

41
00:03:13,140 --> 00:03:14,680
create content specifically for Yangyang,

42
00:03:14,680 --> 00:03:16,940
along with a follow-up incubation plan.

43
00:03:17,140 --> 00:03:18,579
With me as his brother,

44
00:03:18,780 --> 00:03:20,040
in less than ten posts,

45
00:03:20,660 --> 00:03:22,780
I'll definitely make Yangyang go viral.

46
00:03:22,780 --> 00:03:24,960
Viral or not, traffic or no traffic,

47
00:03:25,100 --> 00:03:26,160
it doesn't matter.

48
00:03:26,840 --> 00:03:28,600
As long as Yangyang likes it, that's fine.

49
00:03:28,600 --> 00:03:30,130
Yangyang is my own brother.

50
00:03:30,840 --> 00:03:32,840
I will definitely give him the best.

51
00:03:34,600 --> 00:03:36,130
Thank you for your trouble.

52
00:03:40,079 --> 00:03:40,800
Dad.

53
00:03:44,180 --> 00:03:45,140
Why are you here?

54
00:03:45,579 --> 00:03:46,710
Wait for me outside.

55
00:03:49,420 --> 00:03:50,180
Let's go.

56
00:03:55,480 --> 00:03:56,880
What exactly is going on?

57
00:04:01,440 --> 00:04:03,340
I'm talking about last night.

58
00:04:05,980 --> 00:04:07,600
Right after you brought the person into the room,

59
00:04:07,600 --> 00:04:09,480
the police received a call.

60
00:04:09,600 --> 00:04:11,540
I found out through a friend

61
00:04:11,640 --> 00:04:14,300
that the call was made from the exhibition room.

62
00:04:14,580 --> 00:04:16,980
Everyone at the exhibition has worked with me before.

63
00:04:16,980 --> 00:04:18,510
They would never betray me.

64
00:04:20,040 --> 00:04:21,399
Only you guys

65
00:04:21,640 --> 00:04:23,100
have nothing to do with me.

66
00:04:30,820 --> 00:04:31,440
Father.

67
00:04:32,880 --> 00:04:33,560
I know

68
00:04:34,400 --> 00:04:35,680
I can't lie to you,

69
00:04:36,080 --> 00:04:38,340
because you'll find out sooner or later.

70
00:04:38,940 --> 00:04:40,740
You've always been omnipotent.

71
00:04:42,180 --> 00:04:43,360
I was the one who called the police.

72
00:04:43,360 --> 00:04:44,340
What a sin.

73
00:04:53,600 --> 00:04:55,000
What exactly do you want?

74
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:05,800
Father.

75
00:05:09,000 --> 00:05:10,700
Because I'm scared.

76
00:05:13,080 --> 00:05:15,280
I'm afraid you'll keep making mistakes

77
00:05:15,740 --> 00:05:17,540
and end up on the path of crime.

78
00:05:20,940 --> 00:05:22,600
It's not too late to turn back now.

79
00:05:22,600 --> 00:05:23,400
Father.

80
00:05:24,240 --> 00:05:26,600
Haven't you always taught me since I was little

81
00:05:26,600 --> 00:05:27,960
that in everything we do,

82
00:05:27,960 --> 00:05:30,090
we must not go against our conscience?

83
00:05:33,740 --> 00:05:34,500
Dad.

84
00:05:35,740 --> 00:05:37,100
I really can't bear

85
00:05:38,460 --> 00:05:40,260
to see you keep making mistakes.

86
00:05:47,180 --> 00:05:48,310
Go turn yourself in.

87
00:05:49,140 --> 00:05:49,740
Okay?

88
00:05:54,480 --> 00:05:55,980
Remember what you said.

89
00:06:03,600 --> 00:06:04,220
Hurry.

90
00:06:04,640 --> 00:06:06,140
Notify Brother Chen immediately.

91
00:06:06,140 --> 00:06:07,040
Okay.

92
00:06:11,080 --> 00:06:12,540
Ling Hengsheng has gone back.

93
00:06:12,540 --> 00:06:13,380
Hurry up.

94
00:06:17,640 --> 00:06:19,040
Are you done yet?

95
00:06:19,580 --> 00:06:20,380
Almost.

96
00:06:20,380 --> 00:06:21,440
Don't worry, boss.

97
00:06:22,880 --> 00:06:25,140
Dad, I want to take a video of you next time.

98
00:06:25,140 --> 00:06:27,200
Okay, get in the car first.

99
00:06:31,380 --> 00:06:32,180
Get in.

100
00:06:38,800 --> 00:06:40,140
Send someone to monitor Lingze.

101
00:06:40,140 --> 00:06:41,740
And check on that lawyer again.

102
00:06:41,740 --> 00:06:42,470
Understood.

103
00:06:47,680 --> 00:06:48,840
I want to livestream.

104
00:06:48,840 --> 00:06:50,240
I'm going to livestream.

105
00:06:50,680 --> 00:06:51,880
Your family is back.

106
00:06:52,180 --> 00:06:54,240
None of your business. Keep driving.

107
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:02,840
Dad, I want a company like yours too.

108
00:07:05,480 --> 00:07:06,960
I want one like yours too.

109
00:07:06,960 --> 00:07:09,690
Those companies of mine are all prepared for you.

110
00:07:10,780 --> 00:07:12,710
Go back to your room and rest first.

111
00:07:13,080 --> 00:07:14,120
Take him back.

112
00:07:14,120 --> 00:07:14,840
Let's go.

113
00:07:34,280 --> 00:07:35,060
It's open.

114
00:07:58,900 --> 00:08:00,100
Got it.

115
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:26,020
Your father sent you.

116
00:08:27,400 --> 00:08:28,530
Go back and tell him.

117
00:08:29,280 --> 00:08:31,880
I know what to say and what not to say.

118
00:08:33,440 --> 00:08:35,140
Tell him to keep his promise.

119
00:08:37,640 --> 00:08:39,440
You misunderstood, Uncle Zhao.

120
00:08:39,780 --> 00:08:40,520
I came

121
00:08:41,720 --> 00:08:42,400
for you.

122
00:08:45,180 --> 00:08:45,940
Uncle Zhao.

123
00:08:46,160 --> 00:08:47,240
We know that over the years,

124
00:08:47,240 --> 00:08:48,240
you were forced to help Ling Hengsheng

125
00:08:48,240 --> 00:08:49,780
do many illegal deals.

126
00:08:51,000 --> 00:08:51,640
These are

127
00:08:52,340 --> 00:08:54,120
the means he uses to threaten you,

128
00:08:54,120 --> 00:08:54,740
right?

129
00:08:57,000 --> 00:08:57,800
Who is she?

130
00:08:58,440 --> 00:08:59,300
She is a lawyer,

131
00:09:00,880 --> 00:09:03,410
the daughter of that reporter from back then.

132
00:09:05,840 --> 00:09:06,860
Do you want it?

133
00:09:07,440 --> 00:09:08,400
Let me look at you.

134
00:09:08,400 --> 00:09:09,530
Do you want it or not?

135
00:09:10,840 --> 00:09:11,900
Can you even fight?

136
00:09:18,380 --> 00:09:20,640
We already have enough evidence.

137
00:09:21,540 --> 00:09:23,980
As long as you're willing to cooperate and testify,

138
00:09:23,980 --> 00:09:24,500
I believe...

139
00:09:24,500 --> 00:09:25,140
Enough.

140
00:09:27,640 --> 00:09:29,700
Do you know what you're doing?

141
00:09:30,580 --> 00:09:31,440
You're crazy.

142
00:09:32,440 --> 00:09:33,970
Going against your father?

143
00:09:35,280 --> 00:09:37,240
He is Ling Hengsheng.

144
00:09:40,280 --> 00:09:40,880
Just now,

145
00:09:41,920 --> 00:09:43,340
I didn't hear anything.

146
00:09:43,340 --> 00:09:44,140
Wait.

147
00:09:45,240 --> 00:09:47,040
Please give me a little more time,

148
00:09:47,040 --> 00:09:48,570
and give yourself a chance,

149
00:09:49,540 --> 00:09:52,270
if you don't want to be controlled by him forever.

150
00:09:52,340 --> 00:09:54,240
What else do you want?

151
00:09:59,040 --> 00:10:00,440
Hey, are you okay?

152
00:10:00,800 --> 00:10:02,330
They are all safe and sound.

153
00:10:07,340 --> 00:10:08,060
Honey.

154
00:10:08,060 --> 00:10:08,780
Dad.

155
00:10:12,840 --> 00:10:13,640
Honey,

156
00:10:14,800 --> 00:10:15,420
son,

157
00:10:15,980 --> 00:10:16,480
I'm

158
00:10:18,480 --> 00:10:19,740
sorry.

159
00:10:21,200 --> 00:10:22,200
It's all my fault.

160
00:10:22,200 --> 00:10:23,280
Dad, where are you?

161
00:10:23,440 --> 00:10:25,620
When are you coming to pick us up?

162
00:10:27,480 --> 00:10:29,000
Don't worry about us.

163
00:10:29,280 --> 00:10:31,000
This young man saved us.

164
00:10:31,460 --> 00:10:32,040
Okay.

165
00:10:32,800 --> 00:10:33,320
Okay.

166
00:10:36,300 --> 00:10:37,020
Don't cry.

167
00:10:37,020 --> 00:10:37,600
Chenyao.

168
00:10:37,600 --> 00:10:38,400
It's okay now.

169
00:10:38,740 --> 00:10:41,540
You must ensure the safety of Uncle Zhao's family.

170
00:10:41,640 --> 00:10:42,480
Rest assured.

171
00:10:47,540 --> 00:10:48,200
Uncle Zhao,

172
00:10:48,580 --> 00:10:50,680
for the sake of your family and children,

173
00:10:50,680 --> 00:10:52,040
stop fostering crime

174
00:10:52,380 --> 00:10:53,400
and condoning it.

175
00:10:53,880 --> 00:10:54,940
Cooperate with us.

176
00:11:03,120 --> 00:11:03,700
Okay.

177
00:11:07,780 --> 00:11:09,000
I can't believe

178
00:11:09,400 --> 00:11:10,340
that person's daughter

179
00:11:10,340 --> 00:11:13,070
has been hiding right under our noses for so long.

180
00:11:17,200 --> 00:11:18,000
-Who did this?

181
00:11:22,000 --> 00:11:23,640
Uncle Zhao's family has been rescued.

182
00:11:23,640 --> 00:11:24,900
I don't know who did it.

183
00:11:30,280 --> 00:11:32,080
Get ready to leave immediately.

184
00:11:32,580 --> 00:11:34,180
Wait until things cool down,

185
00:11:34,340 --> 00:11:35,400
then get rid of her.

186
00:11:35,940 --> 00:11:36,480
And

187
00:11:37,840 --> 00:11:38,680
Ling Ze.

188
00:11:39,100 --> 00:11:39,600
Okay.

189
00:11:52,740 --> 00:11:53,540
Hurry.

190
00:11:58,180 --> 00:11:58,640
Ah Long.

191
00:12:09,880 --> 00:12:10,640
What are you doing?

192
00:12:10,640 --> 00:12:11,480
Where is Ling Hengsheng?
